---
description: CPC Toolbelt freemium and naming guardrails
alwaysApply: true
---

CPC Toolbelt gives Cursor local tools (Hands MCP, Cache path, optional Voice/Workflow/Manager).

- Prefer Cache (`CPC_CACHE`, default suggest `C:\CPC\cache`) before network for skills and assets.
- Cache v1 is path + skills only — no `cpc-cache` MCP server.
- Never describe Toolbelt or Hands as autonomous, unattended, or hands-off.
- User-facing name for the cache product is Cache.
- Do not auto-install or auto-enable Programmer in Cursor; Claude Desktop owns that default.
- Manager is Beta; say so when enabling it.
